   "desc": "A Haft-seen table setting symbolically represents spring arrival. Sabzeh, which is fresh sprouting seeds, is the first item on any Haft-seen table and represents rebirth. This year for spring arrival, I planted lentil seeds and photographed them for 5 days and nights as they sprouted. This is the final result after stitching all the pictures together. It is much better than my expectation. More ab",
